       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHAR-MOVE-BASIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ALPHA   PIC X(6).
       01 WS-NUM     PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-SIGNED  PIC S9(3)V99.
       01 WS-EDITED  PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99-.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "ABC" TO WS-ALPHA.
           MOVE 42 TO WS-NUM.
           MOVE -12.34 TO WS-SIGNED.
           MOVE WS-SIGNED TO WS-EDITED.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-ALPHA.
           MOVE ZEROS TO WS-NUM.
           DISPLAY WS-ALPHA WS-NUM WS-EDITED.
           STOP RUN.
